2-3a0c-45b0-b7bb-b53e39ac9757","steps_count":null,"draft_source":"llm"},"type":"card"},{"data":{"form":"annotate","move":"mark","spec":{"mode":"tokens","canvas":{"text":"由题意虚轴长是实轴长的 √7 倍：2b=√7·2a，约去 2 得 b/a=√7，也就是 b=√7a。","type":"tokens","tokens":["由题","意虚","轴长","是实","轴长","的","7","倍","：","2","b","=","7","2","a","，","约去","2","得","b","/","a","=","7","，","也就","是","b","=","7","a","。"]},"n_expected":3,"targets_hint":["已知条件","要求的量","关键限定词"]},"stage":"reading","step_no":0,"card_type":"socratic_interaction","allow_skip":true,"session_id":"62799452-3a0c-45b0-b7bb-b53e39ac9757","skip_label":"我读完了，直接开始","form_source":"router","prompt_lead":"在题面上动笔：把你认为关键的部分标出来。","interaction_id":"ix_0755ec690e5d","routing_reason":"opening×reading×mark×T1→annotate[R3]","interaction_reason":"opening×reading×mark×T1→annotate[R3]","allow_text_fallback":true},"type":"card"}],"msg_id":"7585a9c4-e0c2-4996-9876-2d976181599c"},"attachments":[],"thinking":null,"feedback":null,"feedbackReason":null,"versions":{"index":1,"count":1,"ids":["c11220d1-5fde-4b79-bacb-70de95b6b9c7"]},"interrupted":false},{"id":"b1b5baa3-0dc6-4a50-9b87-c3bc697a3c79","role":"user","clientMsgId":"c01d85cd-573f-4d08-9ee0-063bcc05f5bc","createdAt":"2026-11-22T18:23:39.011476+00:00","envelope":{"role":"user","blocks":[{"type":"markdown","content":"由题意虚轴长是实轴长的 √7 倍：2b=√7·2a，约去 2 得 b/a=√7，也就是 b=√7a。"}],"msg_id":"e0a1776e-60bd-4041-87e3-9cac850aac9d"},"attachments":[],"thinking":null,"feedback":null,"feedbackReason":null,"versions":{"index":1,"count":1,"ids":["b1b5baa3-0dc6-4a50-9b87-c3bc697a3c79"]},"interrupted":false},{"id":"55fdda60-c916-4bef-b2f2-f8ae1c391d12","role":"assistant","clientMsgId":"ai_a2bc4d30-34ad-40f9-9c02-a8f17ad624cc","createdAt":"2026-11-22T18:23:13.814278+00:00","envelope":{"meta":{"badge":"L2-知识库","extra":{"degraded":false,"latency_ms":18047,"chunks_used":4},"skill":"qa_rag","usage":{"tokens_in":4701,"tokens_out":280},"provider":"guided","confidence":0.85,"latency_ms":18938,"ai_generated":true},"role":"assistant","blocks":[{"type":"markdown","content":"你这一步推得挺利索——由 $2b=\\sqrt7\\cdot 2a$ 约去 2 得 $\\frac{b}{a}=\\sqrt7$，即 $b=\\sqrt7 a$，这个变形没问题。\n\n不过我想先跟你确认一下：**题目里除了\"虚轴长是实轴长的 $\\sqrt7$ 倍\"，还有没有别的条件？** 比如焦点在哪个轴上、有没有给焦距或者离心率、有没有过某个点？\n\n因为光有 $\\frac{b}{a}=\\sqrt7$ 这一个关系，双曲线的\"形状\"是定了（开口大小固定），但**大小（$a$ 具体是多少）还没定**——$\\frac{x^2}{a^2}-\\frac{y^2}{7a^2}=1$ 对任意 $a>0$ 都满足这个比例。所以要么题目还给了别的信息，要么这题问的就是一个比值类的量（比如离心率）。\n\n顺便提一句，既然你已经拿到 $\\frac{b}{a}=\\sqrt7$，那离心率其实一步就能出来：\n\n$$e=\\frac{c}{a}=\\sqrt{1+\\left(\\frac{b}{a}\\right)^2}$$\n\n【2】里正好给了这个关系。你先自己算一下这个值是多少？算完把结果告诉我，我们再对一下。\n\n难度：easy"},{"type":"citation","items":[{"n":1,"loc":"《人教A版2019·选择性必修第一册》 选择性必修第一册 5. 离心率 · 切片 f1b74b11","kind":"教材","source":"人教A版2019·选择性必修第一册","chunk_id":"f1b74b11-69b0-489d-95a0-f331fd241bb6"},{"n":2,"loc":"《苏教版·选择性必修第一册》 选择性必修第一册 5. 离心率 · 切片 c9c320d9","kind":"教材","source":"苏教版·选择性必修第一册","chunk_id":"c9c320d9-0d7b-4222-8031-70cdd2d38921"},{"n":3,"loc":"《人教A版2019·选择性必修第一册》 选择性必修第一册 3. 顶点 · 切片 196f92a0","kind":"教材","source":"人教A版2019·选择性必修第一册","chunk_id":"196f92a0-f7ef-4a3f-93b9-e2faa7b23e5c"},{"n":4,"loc":"《苏教版·选择性必修第一册》 选择性必修第一册 3. 顶点 · 切片 7faebff1","kind":"教材","source":"苏教版·选择性必修第一册","chunk_id":"7faebff1-3514-4264-a806-d1fce403b5e8"}]}],"msg_id":"e50ffb13-94b9-4388-961d-119014bc765d"},"attachments":[],"thinking":null,"feedback":null,"feedbackReason":null,"versions":{"index":1,"count":1,"ids":["55fdda60-c916-4bef-b2f2-f8ae1c391d12"]},"interrupted":false},{"id":"839ae115-663d-4fa2-865e-b23903fa18a6","role":"user","clientMsgId":"a2bc4d30-34ad-40f9-9c02-a8f17ad624cc","createdAt":"2026-11-22T18:23:13.763535+00:00","envelope":{"role":"user","blocks":[{"type":"markdown","content":"由题意虚轴长是实轴长的 √7 倍：2b=√7·2a，约去 2 得 b/a=√7，也就是 b=√7a。"}],"msg_id":"662eab5c-9e23-41e6-b19f-ce2c53e9ba89"},"attachments":[],"thinking":null,"feedback":null,"feedbackReason":null,"versions":{"index":1,"count":1,"ids":["839ae115-663d-4fa2-865e-b23903fa18a6"]},"interrupted":false},{"id":"3f44ad5d-4da0-4ef5-b3cd-6b168d28c910","role":"assistant","clientMsgId":"ai_fe4d054e-2633-4459-ab20-0a2f1ee421c5","createdAt":"2026-11-22T18:23:05.046116+00:00","envelope":{"meta":{"extra":{"latency_ms":2532},"skill":"chat","usage":{"tokens_in":4582,"tokens_out":197},"provider":"spark","confidence":0.85,"latency_ms":2579,"ai_generated":true},"role":"assistant","blocks":[{"type":"markdown","content":"你提到的这道双曲线离心率的题目，我先帮你梳理下思路：\n1. 首先回忆双曲线的基本参数关系：双曲线中，实轴长是$2a$，虚轴长是$2b$，离心率$e=\\frac{c}{a}$，且满足$c^2=a^2+b^2$\n2. 题目说虚轴长是实轴长的$\\sqrt{7}$倍，也就是$2b = \\sqrt{7} \\times 2a$，你可以先把这个关系化简，得到$b$和$a$的比值\n3. 再结合$c^2=a^2+b^2$，把$b$用$a$代替，就能算出$c$和$a$的关系，进而得到离心率$e$\n\n你可以先试着按这个思路推导一下，有疑问的地方随时说~"}],"msg_id":"1ee9de0f-00aa-430f-abf1-d6ad7ce885d7"},"attachments":[],"thinking":null,"feedback":null,"feedbackReason":null,"versions":{"index":1,"count":1,"ids":["3f44ad5d-4da0-4ef5-b3cd-6b168d28c910"]},"interrupted":false},{"id":"820c2d02-0801-4730-9d0c-33b176bfb48a","role":"user","clientMsgId":"fe4d054e-2633-4459-ab20-0a2f1ee421c5","createdAt":"2026-11-22T18:23:04.955620+00:00","envelope":{"role":"user","blocks":[{"type":"markdown","content":"请分析我上传的文件"}],"msg_id":"47f48b22-5ba9-4669-8ea2-0cb4cdd7f452"},"attachments":[{"kind":"image","mime":"image/png","name":"题1.png","size":30184,"file_id":"5f3a4fd8-9e56-41b5-921d-fb34233a1344"}],"thinking":null,"feedback":null,"feedbackReason":null,"versions":{"index":1,"count":1,"ids":["820c2d02-0801-4730-9d0c-33b176bfb48a"]},"interrupted":false}],"hasMore":false},"requestId":"b440ac4e-71c9-4e7a-97ad-039f6c54824e"}